1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,297
有个问题，听起来很简单
Here's a question that sounds easy.

2
00:00:02,617 --> 00:00:05,262
井字棋有多少种不同的对局？
How many different games of tic-tac-toe are there?

3
00:00:05,467 --> 00:00:09,362
这里说的“一局”，指的是从第一步到最后一步
By a game, we mean

4
00:00:09,362 --> 00:00:11,393
按顺序排好的全部走法
the whole list of moves, in order.

5
00:00:11,713 --> 00:00:14,669
所以，如果两局最后的棋盘一样
So if two games end with the same board, but the moves happened

6
00:00:14,669 --> 00:00:19,202
但走棋的顺序不同，那它们要算作两种不同的对局
in a different order, they count as two different games.

7
00:00:19,522 --> 00:00:23,090
棋盘翻转或旋转之后的版本，也分开算
Flipped or turned versions count separately too.

8
00:00:24,133 --> 00:00:25,908
猜一猜一百？
Take a guess. A hundred?

9
00:00:26,228 --> 00:00:30,244
一百万？暂停一下视频，把你猜的数写下来
A million? Pause the video and write your guess down.

10
00:00:38,467 --> 00:00:41,259
答案是 255,168
The answer is 255,168.

11
00:00:41,579 --> 00:00:45,980
在这个视频里，我们会弄清楚这个数字是怎么来的
In this video we'll find out where that number comes from: first by careful

12
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:51,147
先仔细地算，再用一段短短的电脑程序，把每一局都下一遍
counting, and then with a short computer program that plays every single game.

13
00:00:52,132 --> 00:00:54,079
先看一个更简单的问题
Let's start with a simpler question.

14
00:00:54,399 --> 00:00:56,805
假设有人三子连成一线了
Suppose the players ignore three in a row, and

15
00:00:56,805 --> 00:01:00,415
双方也不停，一直下到九个格子都填满
just keep going until all nine squares are full.

16
00:01:00,735 --> 00:01:03,486
填满棋盘有多少种不同的顺序？
In how many different orders can the board fill up?

17
00:01:03,732 --> 00:01:06,288
X 先走，有 9 个格子可以选
X goes first and has 9 squares to choose from.

18
00:01:06,608 --> 00:01:09,928
不管 X 下在哪儿，O 都还剩 8 个格子
For each of those, O has 8 squares left.

19
00:01:10,248 --> 00:01:13,509
这就是 9 个 8，所以选择数要相乘
That's 9 groups of 8, so the choices multiply: 9 times

20
00:01:13,509 --> 00:01:17,908
9 乘 8 等于 72，前两步就有 72 种不同的下法
8 is 72 different ways to make the first two moves.

21
00:01:18,132 --> 00:01:23,052
继续乘下去：9 乘 8 乘 7，依此类推，一直乘到 1
Keep going: 9 times 8 times 7, and so on, all the way down to 1.

22
00:01:23,372 --> 00:01:26,215
数学家给这种连乘起了个名字
Mathematicians have a short name for this: nine

23
00:01:26,215 --> 00:01:29,820
9 的阶乘，写成 9 后面加一个感叹号
factorial, written as a 9 with an exclamation mark.

24
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:32,837
它等于 362,880
It equals 362,880.

25
00:01:33,065 --> 00:01:34,514
可是，等一下
But wait.

26
00:01:34,834 --> 00:01:37,835
这比 255,168 还要多
That's more than 255,168.

27
00:01:38,155 --> 00:01:39,814
我们算出来的太多了
Our count is too high.

28
00:01:40,134 --> 00:01:43,064
这些多出来的对局，都是从哪儿来的？
Where are all those extra games coming from?

29
00:01:44,661 --> 00:01:45,802
问题就在这儿
Here's the catch.

30
00:01:46,122 --> 00:01:50,598
真正的井字棋，一有人三子连成一线，就结束了
Real tic-tac-toe stops as soon as someone gets three in a row.

31
00:01:50,918 --> 00:01:56,492
这一局，X 在第 5 步就赢了，所以剩下的四个格子从没下过
In this game, X wins on the fifth move, so the last four squares are never played.

32
00:01:56,728 --> 00:02:01,572
可是 362,880 还是把这几步没下的棋也算进去了
But our 362,880 counted those missing moves

33
00:02:01,572 --> 00:02:04,949
就好像赢了以后，双方还在接着下
anyway, as if the players kept going after the win.

34
00:02:05,269 --> 00:02:09,122
填满这 4 个空格子，有 4 乘 3 乘 2 乘 1
The 4 empty squares can be filled in

35
00:02:09,122 --> 00:02:11,392
也就是 24 种不同的顺序
4 times 3 times 2 times 1, so 24 ways.

36
00:02:11,712 --> 00:02:14,387
所以这一局被算了 24 次！
So this one game got counted 24 times!

37
00:02:14,707 --> 00:02:18,121
我们把这些编出来的对局叫作“幽灵对局”
Let's call those made-up endings ghost games.

38
00:02:18,441 --> 00:02:21,791
我们要让每一局真实的对局都只算一次
We want to count each real game only once.

39
00:02:21,994 --> 00:02:24,128
一局最早什么时候能结束？
So when can a game end?

40
00:02:24,448 --> 00:02:25,980
至少要到第 5 步
Not before move 5.

41
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:30,452
X 下的是第 1、3、5 步，所以到了第 5 步
X plays moves 1, 3 and 5, so the fifth move

42
00:02:30,452 --> 00:02:32,882
才可能有人凑齐三个棋子
is the first time anyone can have three marks.

43
00:02:33,128 --> 00:02:37,726
暂停想一想：有多少种对局是 X 在第 5 步赢下的？
Pause and ponder: how many games end with X winning on move 5?

44
00:02:38,046 --> 00:02:40,364
先自己算一算，再看答案
Try to count them before I show you.

45
00:03:00,594 --> 00:03:02,910
这里有个办法，分三个步骤
Here's one way, in three steps.

46
00:03:03,230 --> 00:03:06,044
第一，选出 X 获胜的那条线
First, pick the line X wins with.

47
00:03:06,364 --> 00:03:10,333
一共有 8 条：3 排、3 列和 2 条对角线
There are 8: 3 rows, 3 columns and 2 diagonals.

48
00:03:10,652 --> 00:03:14,293
第二，X 可以按不同的顺序填满这条线
Second, X fills that line in some order: 3 times

49
00:03:14,293 --> 00:03:19,151
3 乘 2 乘 1，也就是 3 的阶乘，所以有 6 种顺序
2 times 1, which is 3 factorial, so 6 orders.

50
00:03:19,471 --> 00:03:22,983
第三，第一个 O 有另外 6 个格子可以选
Third, O's first mark can go on any of the other 6 squares,

51
00:03:22,983 --> 00:03:27,941
第二个 O 还剩 5 个格子可以选：6 乘 5 等于 30 种放法
and O's second mark on any of the 5 left: 6 times 5 is 30 ways.

52
00:03:28,261 --> 00:03:33,278
把它们乘起来：8 乘 6 乘 30 等于 1,440 种对局
Multiply: 8 times 6 times 30 is 1,440 games.

53
00:03:35,125 --> 00:03:37,557
那 O 在第 6 步赢下的对局呢？
What about games that O wins on move 6?

54
00:03:37,877 --> 00:03:39,770
O 需要三子连成一线
O needs three in a row.

55
00:03:40,090 --> 00:03:43,470
但要小心：如果三个 X 也连成了一线
But careful: if X's three marks also make a line, X already

56
00:03:43,470 --> 00:03:48,717
X 在第 5 步就已经赢了，还没等 O 连完，这一局就结束了
won on move 5, and the game stopped before O could finish.

57
00:03:48,925 --> 00:03:52,436
还是用那三个步骤：O 有 8 条线可选
Use the same three steps: 8 lines for O, 6 orders for O's

58
00:03:52,436 --> 00:03:58,044
O 填满这条线有 6 种顺序，三个 X 有 6 乘 5 乘 4 种放法
marks, and 6 times 5 times 4 ways to place X's three marks.

59
00:03:58,364 --> 00:04:02,559
这样，O 一共有 5,760 种方法连成一线
That's 5,760 ways for O to finish a line.

60
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:07,675
然后再减去 432 种情况：三个 X 也连成了一线
Then we subtract the 432 where X's three marks made a line too,

61
00:04:07,675 --> 00:04:13,305
正好是和 O 那条线平行的一排或一列，所以 X 抢先赢了
a row or column parallel to O's, so X sneaked in a win first.

62
00:04:13,625 --> 00:04:16,541
最后剩下 5,328 种对局
That leaves 5,328 games.

63
00:04:16,725 --> 00:04:20,531
在第 7、8、9 步结束的对局就麻烦多了
For games that end on moves 7, 8 and 9, it gets much worse: we'd have to

64
00:04:20,531 --> 00:04:24,184
我们必须检查之前的每一步有没有人赢
check every earlier move for a win, and

65
00:04:24,184 --> 00:04:28,446
而且下满的棋盘可能是有人赢，也可能是平局
a full board might be a win or a draw.

66
00:04:28,766 --> 00:04:30,553
这就变成了一团乱麻
It turns into a tangled mess.

67
00:04:30,792 --> 00:04:34,113
手算变得这么乱的时候，我们还有 Plan B
When counting gets this messy, there's another plan.

68
00:04:34,433 --> 00:04:39,236
别巧算了不如教电脑学会规则，再让它一局接一局
Don't count cleverly. Instead, teach a computer the

69
00:04:39,236 --> 00:04:41,635
把所有可能的对局都下一遍
rules, and let it play every possible game, one by one.

70
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:45,140
首先，电脑需要一个棋盘
First, the computer needs a board.

71
00:04:45,460 --> 00:04:47,968
我们用一个列表来存 9 个格子
We'll use a list of 9 squares.

72
00:04:48,288 --> 00:04:52,239
我们用的编程语言叫 Python；在 Python 里
In Python, the programming language we're using, the spots in a list

73
00:04:52,239 --> 00:04:57,027
列表里的位置从零开始编号，所以格子的编号是 0 到 8
are numbered starting from zero, so our squares are numbered 0 to 8.

74
00:04:57,347 --> 00:04:58,926
空格子里放一个点
An empty square holds a dot.

75
00:05:00,387 --> 00:05:03,507
接下来，电脑要知道怎样才算赢
Next, the computer needs to know what counts as a win.

76
00:05:03,827 --> 00:05:07,660
我们直接把能让人赢的 8 条获胜线都列出来
We simply list all 8 winning lines,

77
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:10,259
每条线写成一组三个格子编号
as groups of three square numbers.

78
00:05:10,579 --> 00:05:13,906
0、1、2 号格组成最上面一排
Squares 0, 1 and 2 make the top row.

79
00:05:14,226 --> 00:05:17,556
0、4、8 号格组成一条对角线
Squares 0, 4 and 8 make a diagonal.

80
00:05:18,987 --> 00:05:24,519
接下来是一个函数：在编程里，函数就是一小段有名字的程序
Next comes a function: a little mini-program with a name.

81
00:05:24,839 --> 00:05:29,423
这个函数叫 winner，意思是“赢家”，它会检查每一条线
This one, called winner, checks every line.

82
00:05:29,743 --> 00:05:32,768
如果一条线上三个格子放的都一样
If all three squares on a line hold the same mark,

83
00:05:32,768 --> 00:05:36,361
而且不是点，那这是谁的棋子，谁就赢了
and that mark isn't a dot, that player has won.

84
00:05:36,681 --> 00:05:40,310
如果没有一条线符合，winner 什么也没找到
If no line matches, winner finds nothing,

85
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:42,896
就返回 None，意思是“没有人”
and hands back None, which means nobody.

86
00:05:43,850 --> 00:05:47,400
最巧妙的部分来了：一个叫 explore 的函数
Now for the clever part:

87
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:49,687
explore 就是“探索”的意思
a function called explore.

88
00:05:50,007 --> 00:05:53,316
我们告诉它轮到谁，它的任务是统计从
We tell it whose turn it is, and its job is to count

89
00:05:53,316 --> 00:05:56,820
现在这个棋盘往后，还可能出现多少局
every game that can still happen from the current board.

90
00:05:57,050 --> 00:05:59,552
它一开头就是两个停止条件
It starts with two stopping rules.

91
00:05:59,872 --> 00:06:03,088
如果已经有人赢了，那就是下完的一局
If someone has already won, that's one finished

92
00:06:03,088 --> 00:06:05,420
所以 explore 返回数字 1
game, so explore hands back the number 1.

93
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:10,698
如果棋盘满了却没有人赢，那就是平局，也算下完的一局
If the board is full with no winner, that's a draw, also one finished game.

94
00:06:10,917 --> 00:06:13,379
否则，这一局就还没结束
Otherwise, the game isn't over yet.

95
00:06:13,699 --> 00:06:16,459
于是 explore 会试每一个空格子
So explore tries every empty square.

96
00:06:16,779 --> 00:06:21,165
它在那里放上这一方的棋子，再问自己同一个问题
It puts the player's mark there, and then asks itself the same

97
00:06:21,165 --> 00:06:25,170
这次轮到对方：从这里往后，还能下出多少局？
question, now for the other player: how many games can happen from here?

98
00:06:25,490 --> 00:06:27,305
它把所有的答案加起来
It adds up all the answers.

99
00:06:27,583 --> 00:06:31,100
我们把第一个小棋盘放大看看，这时轮到 O
Let's zoom into the first of those, with O to move.

100
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:35,324
如果 O 下在右上角那格，O 就赢了：算 1 局
If O takes the top-right square, O wins: that's 1 game.

101
00:06:35,644 --> 00:06:38,788
擦掉它，这回试试上边中间那格
Erase it, and try the top-middle square instead.

102
00:06:39,107 --> 00:06:43,705
然后 X 填上最后一格，结果是平局：再算 1 局
Then X fills the last square, and it's a draw: 1 more.

103
00:06:44,025 --> 00:06:46,929
撤销这两步，再加起来：2 局
Undo both moves, and add up: 2 games.

104
00:06:47,249 --> 00:06:51,024
再算上另外两个分支，2 加 1 加 2 等于 5
With the other two branches, 2 plus 1 plus 2 makes 5.

105
00:06:51,250 --> 00:06:53,789
像这样，函数自己调用自己
When a function calls itself, asking itself the

106
00:06:53,789 --> 00:06:57,694
也就是自己问自己同一个问题，就叫作递归
same question like this, it's called recursive.

107
00:06:58,014 --> 00:07:00,254
听起来好像会没完没了
That might sound like it goes on forever, but each call

108
00:07:00,254 --> 00:07:05,141
但每调用一次就多一个棋子，所以总会碰到停止条件
adds one more mark, so a stopping rule always kicks in.

109
00:07:05,461 --> 00:07:07,467
想象一棵倒过来的树
Picture an upside-down tree.

110
00:07:07,787 --> 00:07:12,152
空棋盘在最上面，每一种可能的走法是一个分支
The empty board is at the top, every possible move

111
00:07:12,152 --> 00:07:14,930
而下完的每一局都是一片叶子
is a branch, and every finished game is a leaf.

112
00:07:15,250 --> 00:07:18,923
我们的 explore 会沿着每一条分支往下走
Explore walks down every branch, one at

113
00:07:18,923 --> 00:07:22,421
一次走一条，再数一数走到了多少片叶子
a time, and counts the leaves it reaches.

114
00:07:22,650 --> 00:07:25,192
还有一行代码，很容易被忽略
There's one more line, and it's easy to miss.

115
00:07:25,512 --> 00:07:29,812
程序下每一局都用同一个棋盘，就像只有一块白板
The program plays every game on just one board, like a single whiteboard.

116
00:07:30,132 --> 00:07:33,967
所以每探索完一步，它就要擦掉那个棋子
So after exploring a move, it erases that mark.

117
00:07:34,287 --> 00:07:39,776
这叫“撤销”这一步，这样棋盘恢复原样，下一个分支就能接着试
That's called undoing the move, and it means the next branch starts fresh.

118
00:07:40,096 --> 00:07:44,292
先试走一条路，再退回来试下一条，这就叫回溯
Trying a path, then stepping back to try the next one, is called backtracking.

119
00:07:47,110 --> 00:07:51,067
想弄懂一个程序，有个好办法：故意把它改坏
A great way to understand a program is to break it on purpose.

120
00:07:51,387 --> 00:07:56,137
暂停想一想：如果删掉“撤销”那一行，你觉得会发生什么？
Pause and ponder: what do you think happens if we delete the undo line?

121
00:08:06,377 --> 00:08:07,860
程序只输出 3
The program prints just 3.

122
00:08:08,180 --> 00:08:10,762
没有了撤销，什么都不会被擦掉
Without undo, nothing ever gets erased.

123
00:08:11,082 --> 00:08:14,576
程序先下一局，按顺序一格一格地填
The program plays one game, filling the squares

124
00:08:14,576 --> 00:08:17,926
直到 X 在第 7 步连成一条对角线
in order, until X makes a diagonal on move 7.

125
00:08:18,246 --> 00:08:19,387
这是第 1 局
That's 1.

126
00:08:19,707 --> 00:08:24,504
接着它去试 X 的其他下法，可是原来那个 X 还在
Then it tries X's other choices, but the old X is still there.

127
00:08:24,824 --> 00:08:26,891
X 下在下边中间那格
X lands on the bottom-middle square, and the

128
00:08:26,891 --> 00:08:31,118
原来那条对角线又算赢了一次：这是第 2 局
old diagonal counts as a win again: that's 2.

129
00:08:31,438 --> 00:08:34,101
然后是右下角那格：第 3 局
Then the bottom-right square: that's 3.

130
00:08:34,421 --> 00:08:37,293
现在棋盘满了，再也没有可以试的了
Now the board is full, so there's nothing left to try.

131
00:08:37,510 --> 00:08:41,908
现在把“撤销”那一行放回去，改成删掉“判断输赢”
Now put undo back, and delete the winner check

132
00:08:41,908 --> 00:08:44,562
这样对局要等棋盘满了才会停
instead, so games only stop when the board is full.

133
00:08:44,882 --> 00:08:47,049
暂停一下，先猜猜答案
Pause and predict the answer.

134
00:08:57,243 --> 00:08:59,481
362,880
362,880.

135
00:08:59,801 --> 00:09:01,292
这正是 9 的阶乘！
That's nine factorial!

136
00:09:01,612 --> 00:09:06,150
没有了判断输赢，程序在有人赢了之后还会接着下
Without the winner check, the program keeps playing

137
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:09,307
所以它把所有幽灵对局都算进去了
after a win, so it counts all the ghost games.

138
00:09:09,627 --> 00:09:12,801
它自己又找回了我们最早算出的那个数
It rediscovered our very first count.

139
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:17,954
现在，我们把每一行都放回去，运行真正的程序
Now let's put every line back and run the real program.

140
00:09:18,274 --> 00:09:22,244
过了一小会儿，它输出了 255,168
After a moment, it prints 255,168.

141
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:26,704
我们按对局在第几步结束，把这个总数拆开来看
Let's split that total by when each game ends.

142
00:09:27,025 --> 00:09:29,750
1,440 局在第 5 步结束
1,440 end on move 5, and 5,328 on move

143
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:34,983
5,328 局在第 6 步结束，和我们手算的结果一样
6, the same numbers we found by hand.

144
00:09:35,303 --> 00:09:40,425
然后柱子一下子升高了：约 4.8 万局在第 7 步结束
Then the bars shoot up: about 48 thousand

145
00:09:40,425 --> 00:09:42,912
7.3 万局在第 8 步结束
end on move 7, and 73 thousand on move 8.

146
00:09:43,232 --> 00:09:46,654
有一半多一点的对局会下满 9 步
Just over half of all games use all 9 moves:

147
00:09:46,654 --> 00:09:51,421
